<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/unifiedcoms.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>


<!-- ===== 1. Hero ===== -->
<section class="comms-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="comms-plans-row">
      <div class="comms-plans-row__copy" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">UNIFIED COMMUNICATIONS</span>
        <h1>Plans that scale with your team</h1>
        <p>Modern businesses need communication that's seamless, flexible, and built for the way teams actually work.</p>
        <p>We deliver integrated voice and collaboration solutions that keep your people connected in the office, on the road, or working remotely.</p>
        <p>Start with cloud calling and add video, analytics or a full contact centre as you grow.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
      </div>
      <div class="comms-plans-row__media" data-reveal>
        <img src="/images/unified3cxcomms.webp" alt="Unified Communications" class="comms-plans-row__img comms-plans-row__img--back" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ===== 2. CRM logo marquee (full-width divider) ===== -->
<%
  var crms = [
    { file: 'bit',   name: 'Bitrix24' },
    { file: 'fresh', name: 'Freshsales' },
    { file: 'hub',   name: 'HubSpot' },
    { file: 'micro', name: 'Microsoft Dynamics' },
    { file: 'sales', name: 'Salesforce' },
    { file: 'zen',   name: 'Zendesk' },
    { file: 'zoho',  name: 'Zoho' }
  ];
%>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="marquee" role="region" aria-label="Natively integrated CRMs">
    <div class="marquee__track">
      <% [0, 1, 2, 3].forEach(function(copy){ %>
        <% crms.forEach(function(c){ %>
          <img src="/images/<%= c.file %>.webp"
               alt="<%= copy === 0 ? c.name : '' %>"
               <%- copy > 0 ? 'aria-hidden="true"' : '' %>
               height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <% }) %>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ===== 3 & 4. CRM integration ===== -->
<section class="comms-crm">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="comms-crm__head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Natively integrated CRM's</span>
      <h1>Connect your calls to your CRM, then put AI to work</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="comms-integration">
      <div class="comms-integration__copy">
        <p>When your phone system and CRM work together, every customer conversation is captured and your whole team sees the full picture. Calls are logged automatically, customer history is on screen when the phone rings, and your people spend less time on admin and more time with clients.</p>
        <p>We look after it from start to finish. We begin with a consultation to understand how your teams work and what you need from your CRM, then design, build and test the integration, and train your people so it gets used. Ongoing support keeps it working as your business grows.</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="comms-integration__list">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> AI Receptionist</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> AI call screening</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Call transcripts, summaries and sentiment</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> AI generated call summaries straight into your CRM</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Privacy-conscious transcription</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Call reports sent by email</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<!-- ===== Enterprise Solutions / plans carousel ===== -->
<section class="comms-plans">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head section-head--full">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Enterprise Solutions</span>
        <h1>Unified communications that scale with your business</h1>
        <p>When your voice, messaging and collaboration tools work together, your team works better. We deliver unified communications solutions that connect your people in the office, on the road, or working remotely.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
      <div class="carousel__viewport">

        <article class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-card__logo">
            <img src="/images/3cx.webp" alt="3CX" loading="lazy" class="logo-3cx">
          </div>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Make and receive calls from any device: Desk phone, mobile or browser</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited local, national and mobile calls included</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-card__logo">
            <img src="/images/logo-teams.webp" alt="Microsoft Teams Calling" loading="lazy" class="logo-teams">
          </div>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Make external calls directly from Microsoft Teams</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Consolidate your phone system and collaboration into a single Microsoft platform</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-card__logo">
            <img src="/images/logo-cloudpbx.webp" alt="Cloud PBX" loading="lazy" class="logo-cloudpbx">
          </div>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Cloud PBX with no on-site hardware or maintenance required</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Built for hands-on teams who need a bespoke, reliable phone system that just works</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <div class="plan-card__logo">
            <img src="/images/logo-custom.webp" alt="Custom Solutions" loading="lazy" class="logo-custom">
          </div>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Custom solutions tailored to your specific needs</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Flexible pricing options to suit your budget</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="carousel__controls">
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous unified comms plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M10 2L4 8l6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="carousel__progress"><div class="carousel__progress-bar"></div></div>
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next unified comms plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__dots"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ===== Greater Flexibility ===== -->
<section class="comms-features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="feature-strip__head">
      <h1>One platform. Your whole team connected</h1>
      <p>Our unified communications platforms bring calling, collaboration, your CRM and AI together, backed by a local team that knows them inside out.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-strip__grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M8 7l4-4 4 4M8 17l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Secure and scalable</h3>
        <p>Add or remove users as your team changes, with security built in to protect every call and conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20v-4M9 20v-8M14 20v-12M19 20V4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Wholly integrated, with AI</h3>
        <p>Calling, video, messaging and your CRM in one place, with AI tools that handle routine calls and summarise conversations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-card__icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 12c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3s3 1.3 3 3-1.3 3-3 3-3-1.3-3-3zm9 0c0-1.7 1.3-3 3-3s3 1.3 3 3-1.3 3-3 3-3-1.3-3-3z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Expert local support</h3>
        <p>Fully managed by a team that knows your platform inside out, from consultation and set-up to day-to-day support.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>





